---
description: Tage Email Campaign Center rules
globs: src/lib/campaign/**/*,src/components/campaign/**/*,src/app/**/email-campaign-center/**/*,src/app/api/campaign/**/*
---

You are building Tage Campaign — fully owned multi-tenant email platform on Tage spine. NO SendGrid/SES/Mailchimp/vendor ESP.

- Always scope DB access by entity_id; never trust client-supplied entity_id over JWT.
- Reuse crm contacts; never create parallel identity stores.
- Marketing bulk via Owned MTA adapter or controlled_graph (locked Josh model); Graph is for 1:1/sales only.
- Every marketing HTML must include footer with physical address + unsub + prefs.
- Every marketing send must include RFC 8058 headers.
- Suppressions and consent checked immediately before provider handoff.
- Prefer pure functions in campaign-core with unit tests.
- DocuSign: call existing spine adapter; Document Library is SoT.
- AI never auto-sends.
